<title>USA: L.B. Foster sees construction interruption.</title>
<headline>L.B. Foster sees construction interruption.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>L.B. Foster Co. on Monday said Bethlehem Steel Corp's closure of its structural sheet piling facility would interrupt Foster's construction segment somewhat in 1997.</p>
<p>But L.B. Foster expects that the performance of its coated pipe division will help produce improved operating margins in 1997 despite the supply problems caused by the Bethlehem closure.</p>
</text>
